window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I thought I was in control. I was wrong.</b></p> <p>I've led the Omegaborn for years, but the moment these brutes arrived from beyond the wall I knew everything was about to change. These beasts aren't here to take orders from me - they're here to take me the way I was meant to be taken, no matter how desperately I resist what I need.</p> <p>Naked, punished, and sore, all I can do is scream out one savage, shameful climax after another as my body is claimed, used, and mastered. I'm about to learn what it means to be an omega....</p> <p><i>Fever</i> is the third book of The Omegaborn Trilogy. It includes spankings and intense sexual scenes. If such material offends you, please don't buy this book.</p>"; 
